        <Param val="True" valType="bool" updates="None" name="syncScreenRefresh"/>
        <Param val="TASK INSTRUCTIONS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you for agreeing to participate in today's experiment!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please make sure to read all following instructions carefully.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This experiment offers you an opportunity to access a number of calligraphy art pieces. Each calligraphy is associated with a different level of effort, i.e., number of steps needed to access it.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;When a calligraphy is presented, collect it by pressing [SPACE] for each step necessary. When the number of steps needed to collect a given calligraphy is reached, you will proceed to the next one. Try performing the steps as quickly as you can. Note that each calligraphy will be presented on the screen for a limited amount of time. There will be a 5 second rest period following the collection of each calligraphy.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;When the required number of steps is reached you will sometimes become the buyer and sometimes you will become the seller of the art piece. These two situations are separate so please consider them independently.&amp;#10;We will give you more instructions shortly. " valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
